=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55768f97b31afe989c318f31cfa94ebd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/843be636/uploads/origins/96841c20-bf5a-4476-9f59-9f9b03af07d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55768f97b31afe989c318f31cfa94ebd, https://si.imgix.net/843be636/uploads/origins/96841c20-bf5a-4476-9f59-9f9b03af07d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74896498aecd16b521a7639b148c1475 2x, https://si.imgix.net/843be636/uploads/origins/96841c20-bf5a-4476-9f59-9f9b03af07d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c98c4ac0ce3c58fc1cce444de3132584 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your artstyle so much!!!!\n\nWould you draw my vtuber self? She is a friendly, energetic, cheerful, religious girl!\n\nI would like a picture of her baking or cooking in a cute cottage kitchen! Maybe she can be looking a little overwhelmed, cooking something really complicated, making a little bit of a mess in the kitchen?\n\nI think it would be cute to have her wearing an apron, and having her hair pulled back into a ponytail instead of her usual braids! (Since she's cooking)\n\nIf you don't like this idea , feel free to draw whatever you like! Please keep it cute and modest! \n\nThank you so much!!!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/prayersfromabi/status/1395914587665571842?s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@momigiko/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc5416be/uploads/origins/1aa217e2-bee4-44d5-85fd-c91ec3783f2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ff956c427123c3cfa039c191c6648bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc5416be/uploads/origins/1aa217e2-bee4-44d5-85fd-c91ec3783f2d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ff956c427123c3cfa039c191c6648bf, https://si.imgix.net/bc5416be/uploads/origins/1aa217e2-bee4-44d5-85fd-c91ec3783f2d?bg=%23fff